description:
The project's development objective is to sustainably improve the incomes, food security, and nutrition of small producers, women, youth, and indigenous peoples in 3 provinces of Gabon. It will specifically involve:
- improve the agricultural policy environment with a view to increasing public and private investment through an efficient and sustainable system for developing, implementing and monitoring subsector policies and strategies;
- promote economic activities and entrepreneurship in the agropastoral value-chain with a view to improving income, food security and nutrition.
